      "inner_conj_symm + map_div₀ + field_simp handles conjugate-linearity algebra",
      "Same proof works for R and C simultaneously via RCLike abstraction",
      "mul_right_cancel₀ key for canceling norm v from both sides",
      "pow_eq_zero_iff two_ne_zero bridges norm squared = 0 to norm = 0"
